e your goalkeeping skills. With Goalie, you'll be able to practice your reflexes and hand-eye coordination in a fun and immersive environment. The game features intuitive controls and realistic physics, making it easy to jump right in and start playing. Whether you're a seasoned goalkeeper or just looking for a new way to get active, Goalie is a great choice. So why wait? Put on your VR headset and get ready to defend your goal!", "short_description": "Goalie is a VR game that puts you in the goalkeeper role. Suitable for all ages and featuring a calming design, it's great for daily exercise and improving goalkeeping skills. With realistic physics and intuitive controls, it's easy to jump right in and start playing. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just looking for a fun way to get active, Goalie is a great choice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bitti-gitti.com/vr/goalie#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bitti Gitti", "support_website_url": "https://www.bitti-gitti.com/vr/goalie", "website_url": "https://www.bitti-gitti.com/vr/goalie", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "718475149822501"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1236377761064539"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3027472070891305"}, {"status": "